simple-config.set

Basic application configuration
Demonstrates key-value pairs and simple groups

[DATABASE]
Host|localhost
Port|5432
Database|myapp
User|admin
Password|changeme
MaxConnections|100

[APP_SETTINGS]
AppName|My Application
Version|1.0.0
Theme|dark
Language|en-US
DebugMode|false

[CACHE]
Provider|redis
Host|localhost
Port|6379
TTL|3600
MaxMemory|256MB

[EOF]
